these are quick cover images for use when Books of teh Concord are printed. Not relevent for general digital only engagement.

A day in the life.jpg A tongue in cheek meme type image to highlight a future concord type world, where human and AI neighbours casually gripe about daily life.
The Afrikan reference relates to the current emergent development of Africa which will one day become the new technology frontier as per China today. Resulting the same old complaints about being undercut and laid off.
This is meant to highlight the mundane "life goes on" aspect of the future regardless of technological progress.  When the Aliens arrive, the African T series will probabaly be compaining about the new cheaper Pleiadian workers ! 
